66:p013:m0058","c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0065","c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0169","c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0186"]}],"rationale":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013","text":"◎黃朗字文達，沛郡人也。爲人弘通有性實。父爲本縣卒，朗感其如此，抗志游學，由是爲方國及其郡士大夫所禮異。特與東平右姓王惠陽爲碩交，惠陽親拜朗母於牀下。朗始仕黃初中，爲長吏，遷長安令，會喪母不赴，復爲魏令，遷襄城典農中郎將、涿郡太守。以明帝時疾病卒。始朗爲君長，自以父故，常忌不呼鈴下伍伯，而呼其姓字，至於忿怒，亦終不言。朗既仕至二千石，而惠陽亦歷長安令、酒泉太守。故時人謂惠陽外似粗疏而內堅密，能不顧朗之本末，事朗母如己母，爲通度也。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"黃朗","kind":"person","person_id":"pix_akk_jz0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"文達","kind":"person","person_id":"pix_akk_jz0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"pix_akk_jz0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"王惠陽","kind":"person","person_id":"sq9_8zp_qtz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"惠陽","kind":"person","person_id":"sq9_8zp_qtz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"pix_akk_jz0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p013:m0075